            "review_title": "Review at Phở Đức - 66 Hà Trung",
            "review_text": "矢部英貴\nSetagaya, Japan34 contributions\n0\nHere's a cheap and delicious pho.\nDec 2024 • Couples\nIt is a light soup of Japanese taste, infused with the taste of beef. We had pho in many places and we thought this was the best. For a place like this, it's clean and the staff is pleasant. They also seem to be doing beef hot pot, so I thought I'd try it here. This is a place for those who simply want to eat. We had a noon meal on the day of our arrival, but went again on the last night.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten December 26, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
